   "lines": [
    "Jack Elliott and",
    "I went in my",
    "boat to Loyds",
    "Neck; the wind was",
    "three quarters aft,",
    "so we rigged the",
    "~~sail~~ ^mast^, so[?] with sail,",
    "oars and paddle",
    "managed to make",
    "pretty good time.",
    "We shot through",
    "the lagoons, took",
    "lunch, had tough",
    "work getting out of",
    "the marsh, as the tide",
    "was ^dead^ low, rowed home",
    "against a head wind."
   ],
